  "title": "Mood Ka Schedule Nahi Hota — Pattern Ka Hota Hai",
  "body": "Subah comparison, dopahar avoidance, raat 2 baje wahi ek conversation replay — mera wound timetable se chalta tha.\nMaine use saalon tak 'mood' kaha. Par mood ka schedule nahi hota — pattern ka hota hai.\nAur jo track nahi hota, woh kabhi interrupt nahi hota. AB 2.0 pehle language deta hai, phir interrupt.",
