  "body": "Jise main dushman samajh kar barson lada, woh ek dara hua bachcha nikla jise kabhi safe feel nahi hua.\n\nTab se woh usi darr mein jee raha hai — har waqt khud ko bachaane ki koshish mein.\n\nUs bachche se ladne ki nahi thi. Paas baithne ki zaroorat thi.",
