  "kind": "post",
  "title": "Teri anxiety future ki nahi hai",
  "body": "Har baar mujhe laga meri anxiety aane wale kal ke baare mein hai.\n\nPhir samjha — yeh future ki nahi thi. Yeh meri us purani, anchuki baat ka aaj ke pal mein dohraav thi.\n\nJise main aane wale kal ka darr samajhta raha, woh beete hue kal ki adhoori dhadkan thi.",
