  "kind": "post",
  "title": "Publish kiya — aur nausea aayi",
  "body": "Maine post publish kiya. Button dabaya.\n\nMere mind ne kaha \"sab theek hai, handle ho jaayega\" — par body ne nausea bhej di.\n\nDikhna hi woh kaam tha jisse main sabse zyada darta tha.",
