  "title": "Gusse par spiritual line maari — aur gussa andar dab gaya",
  "body": "Gussa aaya. Maine uspar ek spiritual line chipka di — 'main detached rehna chahta hoon,' 'yeh sab maya hai.'\n\nGussa kahin gaya nahi. Bas seene ke neeche dab gaya.\n\nYeh wisdom nahi hai — yeh tezaab pe powder chhidakna hai. Avoidance, par ache shabdon mein.\n\nApni feelings ke saath bhi to wafaadari banti hai.",
