  "kind": "post",
  "title": "'Seen' hua, chest tight ho gayi — matlab sirf 'busy hai' nahi",
  "body": "Mera message 'seen' hua aur jawab nahi aaya. Seene mein ek kasaav aaya.\n\nWoh sirf anxiety nahi thi. Woh mera andar ka woh hissa tha jo us ek 'seen' se tay karne laga — main maayne rakhta hoon ya nahi.\n\nIska matlab har baar 'woh busy hai' nahi hota.\nKabhi iska matlab sirf itna hota hai — tum bahut der se khud ko saabit karte aa rahe ho.",
