  "title": "Dost ki success dekhi — pehla thought comparison tha, badhaai nahi",
  "body": "Dost ki kamyaabi sunte hi mera pehla reflex badhaai nahi tha — comparison tha. Andar wahi purana hisaab chal pada: har kisi ki progress ko apni se naapne waala.\n\nBaad mein dikha — yeh rashk nahi tha. Yeh apni value ka darr tha, doosre ke naam pe khada.\n\nJis din meri khushi uski jeet pe sach mein aayi, us din samjha — main apne aap se milna shuru ho gaya hoon.",
