  "body": "Scroll karte karte ek purani photo pe meri ungli ruk gayi. Doosri pe itni der nahi ruka, is pe ruk gaya.\n\nWoh nostalgia nahi tha — woh khud se ek chhoti si baat thi. Main andar hi andar puchh raha tha: 'main wahan se yahan kaise aa gaya? Aur jahan jaana chahta tha — woh kahan reh gaya?'\n\nPhoto wahi thi. Sawaal naya tha.",
