  "kind": "post",
  "title": "Koi genuinely kind tha — aur tumne socha: 'yeh kya chahta hai?'",
  "body": "Koi sach mein achha hua mere saath, aur meri pehli reaction thi — shaq. 'Yeh kya chahta hai?'\n\nYeh cynicism nahi hai — yeh tumhara purana threat map hai jo abhi bhi chal raha hai. Kisi waqt achhe behaviour ke peeche sach mein koi bill chhupa hota tha, aur body ne yaad rakh liya.\n\nDikkat unmein nahi — woh purana naqsha abhi tak update nahi hua.",
