  "kind": "post",
  "title": "Maa-baap ki line abhi bhi tumhare andar chal rahi hai — tum bade ho gaye, woh nahi",
  "body": "Bachpan mein ek line andar baith gayi thi — 'inhe disappoint karna galat hai.'\n\nMain bada ho gaya. Apna kamaata hoon, apne faisle leta hoon. Woh log ab kamre mein bhi nahi hote. Par boundary set karne se pehle pet mein wahi purana khinchav aata hai.\n\nWoh log chale gaye. Awaaz reh gayi.",
