  "kind": "post",
  "title": "Kareebi logon se bhi professional doori — yeh maturity nahi",
  "body": "Jo log apne sabse kareebi logon se bhi ek professional doori rakhte hain — main pehle sochta tha woh mature hain.\n\nNahi. Woh itni baar chot kha chuke hain ki ab nazdeeki inaam nahi, khatra lagti hai. Har kareeb aaya insaan ek possible chot ban jaata hai — isliye sabko arm's length par rok dete hain.\n\nYeh thandapan nahi hai — yeh ek dhaal hai.\n\nAur dhaal ki ek baat hai: jo dikh jaaye, woh utaari bhi ja sakti hai.",
