  "title": "Khud par kuch kharch karke khud ko saza dena",
  "body": "Maine bhi yeh kiya hai — khud par thoda paisa kharch kiya, aur phir din bhar khud ko uske liye saza di.\n\nUs waqt samajh nahi aaya. Ab aata hai: main apni zaroorat ko gunaah maan raha tha. Apni chaah ko kamzori.\n\nWoh kharch jurm nahi tha. Bas tumhe kabhi seekhne hi nahi diya gaya — ki khud ke liye kuch chaahna theek bhi hai.",
