  "kind": "post",
  "title": "Boardroom mein main freeze ho gaya",
  "body": "Deloitte ki us meeting mein sab bol rahe the, aur main bas nod kar raha tha. Andar heartbeat itni tez ki laga koi sunn lega. Sabko laga main soch raha hoon — main sirf saans rok raha tha. Ghar aakar samjha: main galat kaam mein achha ban raha tha. Jise duniya dream job kehti hai, mera panic attack usi kursi pe baitha tha. Notice tab nikla jab body ne pehle hi bol diya tha — ye tumhari jagah nahi.",
