  "body": "Sabne socha main gayab ho gaya. Sach ye tha ki main ek kamre mein band tha, 450 kitaabon ke beech. Gita se shuru, nervous system pe khatam. Har page pe khud ke ek sawaal ka jawaab dhoondh raha tha. Log kehte the time waste kar raha hai — main apne tootne ka manual likh raha tha. Woh saal padhai nahi thi, woh khud ko dobara jodna tha. Jab lauta, kitaabein kam thi — main zyada tha.",
