  "title": "Maine kamaya, Mummy sandwich banati rahi",
  "body": "Pehli baar jab maine paise kamaye, main daudte hue Mummy ko batane gaya. Woh sandwich bana rahi thi. Sunn liya, ek 'accha' bola, aur haath chalte rahe. Bas itna. Main wahin khada reh gaya. Us din samajh aaya main achievement nahi, ek nazar dhoond raha tha — jo mujhe dekhe, kaam ko nahi. Saalon baad samjha: Mummy ke haath rukey nahi, kyunki unhe kabhi kisi ne dekha hi nahi tha. Main woh maang raha tha jo unke paas tha hi nahi.",
