  "body": "Sabse badi khushi mujhe 10,000 readers pe hui thi. Laga koi sach mein padh raha hai. Phir number badhte gaye — 1 lakh, phir 1 million. Aur woh pehli wali khushi laut ke kabhi nahi aayi. Har naya number pichle se bada tha, magar khaali. Tab samjha — main logon se juda tha jab woh 10,000 the, aur ginti se juda ho gaya jab woh million ho gaye. Numbers badhte gaye, main mehsoos karna bhool gaya.",
