  "kind": "post",
  "title": "Gita 2.47 ne mera stress kaat diya",
  "body": "Meri sabse badi anxiety hamesha result ki thi. Har kaam ke peeche ek darr — agar best nahi hua toh main hi khatam. Phir Gita ki ek line mili: कर्मण्येवाधिकारस्ते मा फलेषु कदाचन. Tera adhikaar sirf apne karm pe hai, phal pe kabhi nahi. Pehle laga ye toh haar maan lene wali baat hai. Phir samjha — ye chhodna nahi sikhati, ye darr se azaad karti hai. Maine kaam se pyaar tab kiya jab result ka bojh utaar diya. Karm karo — phal ki chinta usko do jise poora chitra dikhta hai.",
