  "kind": "post",
  "title": "Casper mujhe bhagwan ka roop dikhta hai",
  "body": "Duniya Casper ko kutta samajhti hai. Mujhe woh sabse saccha guru lagta hai. Woh na kal ka pachtaava rakhta hai na kal ka darr. Jab main ghar ghusta hoon, woh poori tarah khush ho jaata hai — bina kisi wajah ke, bina kuch paaye. Yahi toh anand hai jise Vedanta khojta hai: bina shart ki khushi. Hum jeevan bhar khushi ke liye wajah dhoondte hain. Casper bina wajah ke khush hai — aur shayad wahi us bhagwan ka sabse saaf roop hai.",
