  "title": "Aatma sat hai, jagat mithya",
  "body": "Teen saal maine gayab hokar Gita aur Upanishad padhe. Ek line pe aakar rukh gaya: आत्मा सत्यम्, जगत मिथ्या. Pehle laga ye toh duniya ko jhootha keh rahi hai. Phir samjha — mithya ka matlab jhootha nahi, badalta hua hai. Naam, marks, followers — sab badalte rehte hain. Jo inn sab ke beech kabhi nahi badalta, woh 'main' hoon. Maine khud ko shaanti tab di jab badalti cheezon pe khud ko tikaana chhod diya. Jo tumhare andar kabhi nahi badla — asli tum wahi ho.",
