  "title": "Maine 650 se zyada logon ke saath ye jeeya",
  "body": "Jo maine 450 kitaabon aur teen saal ke ekaant mein samjha, woh maine ek jagah rakh diya — Aham Brahmasmi. Ye therapy nahi, religion nahi, fake motivation bilkul nahi. Ye Vedanta aur modern psychology ka woh pul hai jisse main khud toota hua se poora hua. Ab tak 650 se zyada log ise jee chuke hain, apni har roz ki ghabraahat, self-doubt aur pehchaan ke sawaalon ke saath. Agar aap bhi 'main aakhir hoon kaun' ke sawaal pe atke ho — shayad agla kadam yahi hai. Koi jaldi nahi. Jab taiyaar ho, main yahin hoon.",
