  "title": "Psychology map deti hai, Vedanta padhne wala",
  "body": "Kai saal maine trauma aur nervous system ki kitaabein padhi. Unhone mujhe apne dimaag ka naksha diya — kyun main ghabraata hoon, kyun bhaagta hoon. Par ek sawaal reh gaya: ye naksha padh kaun raha hai? Wahan Vedanta aayi. Psychology aapko map deti hai; Vedanta aapko woh deti hai jo us map ko padhta hai. Aham Brahmasmi mein maine dono ko ek saath rakha hai. Agar aap khud ko samajhna chahte ho, sirf manage nahi karna — toh ye aapke liye ban hi is soch se hai. Koi pressure nahi, sirf ek raasta.",
