  "body": "Meri team ne mana kiya, phir bhi maine Aham Brahmasmi pe 100% refund rakha. Kyunki mere papa ne ek cheez sikhayi thi — jab insaan ko woh do jo woh sach mein chahta hai, imaandari se, toh woh khud aakar leta hai. Main aapko darr se, urgency se, 'aaj hi lo warna' se nahi bulana chahta. Agar ye aapke kaam ka hai, toh ruk kar dekho, phir aao. Aur pasand na aaye toh paisa wapas. Main ek reader ke saath sauda nahi, ek seeker ke saath rishta banana chahta hoon.",
