  "kind": "reel",
  "title": "R1 - Jab Main Suicidal Tha, Kisi Ne Roka",
  "body": "Phir mujhe woh waqt yaad aata hai — woh breakup, woh depression, woh phase jab main sach mein suicidal tha.\n\nUs lamhe par, jab main bilkul kinaare par tha, mujhe laga jaise kisi cheez ne mujhe roka. Kuch tha jo mujhe aage badhne se rok gaya.\n\nMujhe mehsoos hua jaise Mahadev mere peeche khade hain, keh rahe hain — ruk jaa. Bas ruk jaa.\n\nAur us din maine yeh maan liya. Maine believe kar liya.",
  "pillar": "",
  "status": "draft",
